{'symbol': 'HRL', 'date': '2022-04-21 13:00:00', 'title': 'HORMEL FOODS ON TRACK TO MATCH 100% OF DOMESTIC ENERGY USE WITH RENEWABLE SOURCING BY END OF 2022', 'text': 'WIND AND SOLAR PROJECTS HELPING DRIVE THE COMPANY TOWARD ITS 20 BY 30 CHALLENGE RENEWABLE ENERGY GOAL AUSTIN, MINN. , APRIL 21, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- HORMEL FOODS CORPORATION (NYSE: HRL), A GLOBAL BRANDED FOOD COMPANY WELL KNOWN FOR ITS CORPORATE CITIZENSHIP, IS PLEASED TO ANNOUNCE THAT IT ANTICIPATES MATCHING 100% OF ITS DOMESTIC ENERGY USE WITH RENEWABLE SOURCING BY THE END OF 2022.'}